<div class="wanelo-page" role="article">
  {%- comment -%}
    ABOVE-collapse zone — minimal, just signals + engagement:
    - rating (compact star row, social proof 0.3s)
    - trust strip (one-line inline row of icons, no boxed look)
    - videos (engagement preview)
    Research refs MOVED inside collapse next to trust/clinical-evidence
    (authority/proof zone) where it logically belongs in long-form structure.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    Rating REMOVED (operator request, 2026-05-27). Synthetic "4.7 / 847
    verified reviews" was a fake trust signal — FTC fraud risk and the
    Hyper-new theme already exposes price near the title where the rating
    would go. Trust strip also removed earlier. Snippet + CSS kept on disk
    for future real-review integration (Judge.me / Loox / Stamped sync).
  {%- endcomment -%}
