  {%- comment -%}
    AUTO-DISCOVER zone — render any custom.* metafield Designer emitted
    that doesn't have a dedicated wanelo-*.liquid snippet yet. Pipeline
    auto-creates definitions on-the-fly (see Cell 14), this loop catches
    them on the storefront. Falls through to wanelo-auto-section.liquid
    which detects the JSON shape and renders in matching Apple style.

    KNOWN_SECTIONS = every key that has its own dedicated snippet above.
    When operator builds a custom snippet for an auto-discovered key,
    add the key to this list so the duplicate fallback render is skipped.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign known_sections = "hero,target_profile,brand_story,story,features,video_demo,lifestyle_gallery,ingredients,nutrition_facts,how_to,use_scenarios,protocol,mistake_warnings,timeline,progress_milestones,clinical_evidence,research_refs,stats,specs,compatibility,app_showcase,size_guide,dimensions,room_placement,variants,care,whats_included,assembly,gift_options,subscription_refill,compare,trust,sustainability,safety,reviews,faq,cta,interlinks,palette,videos,rating,trust_strip,unboxing_journey,photo_pack,source,source_url,designer_prompt,html_description,og_image,title_tag,description_tag" | split: "," -%}
  {%- for mf in product.metafields.custom -%}
    {%- assign mf_key = mf[0] -%}
    {%- unless known_sections contains mf_key -%}
      {%- render 'wanelo-auto-section', key: mf_key -%}
    {%- endunless -%}
  {%- endfor -%}

